      "category": "Philosophy",
      "type": "actionable",
      "headline": "Master the Graceful Exit",
      "body": "Good conversations leave both people energized, not trapped. You don't need an elaborate excuse to leave. A warm, direct closing honors both your time and the conversation you just shared.",
